      "hints": [
        "$E$ is four units above $B$; write its position vector.",
        "Subtract $\\overrightarrow{OE}$ from $\\overrightarrow{OF}$, then normalize."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "$\\overrightarrow{OE}=6\\mathbf{i}+3\\mathbf{j}+4\\mathbf{k}$, so $\\overrightarrow{EF}=\\overrightarrow{OF}-\\overrightarrow{OE}=-6\\mathbf{i}-3\\mathbf{j}+2\\mathbf{k}$.",
        "$|EF|=\\sqrt{36+9+4}=7$; the unit vector is $\\frac17(-6\\mathbf{i}-3\\mathbf{j}+2\\mathbf{k})$."
      ]
